#: ../../trades.md:1 82e49573f8424a99b791d037f2ea745d
msgid "The trade builder"
msgstr "交易編寫器"

#: ../../trades.md:3 9e5dff4802f546f9b40cf023737a449c
msgid "An option is authored as four independent choices — **payoff × exercise × underlying × style** — with quanto composing over all four rather than multiplying into products of its own. A swap is authored as *n* legs with a schedule each."
msgstr "選擇權由四個獨立選擇編寫而成——**收益函數 × 履約 × 標的 × 類型**——而 quanto 疊加在這四者之上，而不是自成一組乘出來的商品。利率交換則編寫成 *n* 個計息腳，每腳各有排程。"

#: ../../trades.md:8 77b64144313149ecb2c4ffdee848cc1e
msgid "Styles, and what each one accepts"
msgstr "各種類型，以及各自接受什麼"

#: ../../trades.md ef16e680738d4cd5959aba4dd64824e6
msgid "Style"
msgstr "類型"

